sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Other entity
    participant FM as Managing IMRFM
    participant IMR as Managed IMR namespace
    Client->>FM: request to IMRFM request topic
    FM->>IMR: publish IMR identity/status/odometry under IMR topic namespace
    FM->>Client: publish requestStatus on request status topic
    Note over FM,IMR: IMRFM may accept requests on behalf of managed IMR
